@baseUrl = http://localhost:5184

### 1. Submit a valid subscription contact request (public, returns 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "9f3d2a1b-4c5e-4f6a-8b7c-1d2e3f4a5b6c",
  "fullName": "Carlos Mendoza",
  "companyName": "Constructora Andina SAC",
  "email": "cmendoza@andina.pe",
  "phone": "+51 987 654 321",
  "segment": "CONSTRUCTION",
  "plan": "PRO",
  "message": "Necesitamos controlar despachos y recepciones en tres obras en Lima.",
  "locale": "es"
}

### 2. Missing required fields (returns 400 Bad Request listing missing fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Carlos Mendoza",
  "email": "correo-invalido"
}
